model lh11
  tally 2
  on 2026-10-18
  start 2026-01-01
  end 2026-12-31
  note "Five loan problems of the SOA Exam FM sample set: Q60 (refinance, solve the new rate), Q87 (deferred annual payments and a drop payment), Q89 (extra payments shorten a mortgage), Q130 (a student loan drawn monthly at two rates), Q133 (refinance with level payments of 500 and a drop payment)."
  note "No currency is named, so amounts are XXX. Interest is nominal convertible monthly unless a question says otherwise, and payments are at the end of each period. Present values use a_n = (1 - v^n)/i and accumulations s_n = ((1 + i)^n - 1)/i, the solutions' definitions."
  note "No question states a rounding rule. Axis lh11_step says whether the intermediates the solutions print rounded are carried rounded into the next step; axis lh11_mode gives the unstated mode, also for the figures as printed. Answers are matched to the nearest choice."

source lifted_1_0_1 "Figures tally 1.0.1 allowed inline in rules"

source soa_q "Society of Actuaries, Exam FM Financial Mathematics, Exam FM Sample Questions (update history ending 'October 2022: Questions 208-275 were added'), mirror file 2018-10-exam-fm-sample-questions.pdf" at "https://www.math.purdue.edu/~sallyray/From%20SOA%20MA373_files/2018-10-exam-fm-sample-questions.pdf"

source soa_s "Society of Actuaries, Exam FM Financial Mathematics, Exam FM Sample Solutions (same edition), mirror file 2018-10-exam-fm-sample-solutions.pdf" at "https://www.math.purdue.edu/~sallyray/From%20SOA%20MA373_files/2018-10-exam-fm-sample-solutions.pdf"

unit XXX: currency minor 0.01

axis lh11_mode
  down "a printed or carried figure truncated at its places; no question states a mode"
  half-up "a printed or carried figure rounded to the nearest at its places; no question states a mode"

axis lh11_step
  exact "every intermediate is carried exact; only the figures asked are rounded, at their printed places"
  printed "the solutions' method: each intermediate the solution prints rounded and then reuses (Q60 payment, Q87 rate, Q89 payment and annual rate, Q130 factors, Q133 payment, annuity factor and ratio) is carried rounded at its printed places"

index choice = [opt_a, opt_b, opt_c, opt_d, opt_e]

index q130_part = [first2, next2]

index q89_yr = int 1..5

input q130_acc_0_0001: num
  note "lifted from an inline figure of tally 1.0.1"

input q130_acc_12: int
  note "lifted from an inline figure of tally 1.0.1"

input q130_draw: money XXX

input q130_opt[o in choice]: money XXX

input q130_rate[p in q130_part]: rate

input q130_s_0_0001: num
  note "lifted from an inline figure of tally 1.0.1"

input q130_s_12: int
  note "lifted from an inline figure of tally 1.0.1"

input q130_years[p in q130_part]: int

input q133_a_left_0_0001: num
  note "lifted from an inline figure of tally 1.0.1"

input q133_first: date

input q133_first_new: date

input q133_loan: money XXX

input q133_n_12: int
  note "lifted from an inline figure of tally 1.0.1"

input q133_new_pay: money XXX

input q133_new_rate: rate

input q133_opt[o in choice]: date

input q133_rate: rate

input q133_refi: date
  note "the date of the last regular payment before the refinancing"

input q133_x_0_00001: num
  note "lifted from an inline figure of tally 1.0.1"

input q133_years: int

input q60_cut: money XXX
  note "the amount by which each payment is lower after the refinancing"

input q60_gap_12: int
  note "lifted from an inline figure of tally 1.0.1"

input q60_j: rate question "What rate j, convertible monthly, makes the lower payments repay the balance over the remaining term?"

input q60_loan: money XXX

input q60_n_12: int
  note "lifted from an inline figure of tally 1.0.1"

input q60_new_years: int

input q60_newpv_12: int
  note "lifted from an inline figure of tally 1.0.1"

input q60_opt[o in choice]: rate

input q60_paid: int

input q60_rate: rate

input q60_years: int

input q87_d: rate

input q87_first: int
  note "the time in years of the first payment after the loan is taken out"

input q87_i_0_0001: num
  note "lifted from an inline figure of tally 1.0.1"

input q87_loan: money XXX

input q87_opt[o in choice]: money XXX

input q87_pmt: money XXX

input q89_extra[y in q89_yr]: money XXX
  note "the extra payment at the end of loan year y, on December 31 of year 2002 + y, made with the regular payment"

input q89_first_pay: date

input q89_j_0_0001: num
  note "lifted from an inline figure of tally 1.0.1"

input q89_loan: money XXX

input q89_n_12: int
  note "lifted from an inline figure of tally 1.0.1"

input q89_opt[o in choice]: date

input q89_rate: rate

input q89_years: int

def q130_acc[p in q130_part]: num at reader
  rule base = pow(1 + q130_i[p], q130_acc_12 * q130_years[p])
  rule printed beats base v v_soa_s = round(pow(1 + q130_i[p], q130_acc_12 * q130_years[p]), q130_acc_0_0001, lh11_mode) when lh11_step == printed

def q130_bal: num XXX at reader
  note "the balance at the end of four years: the first two years' draws accumulated at 6% and then carried at 8%, plus the last two years' draws at 8%"
  rule base v v_soa_s = q130_draw * (q130_s[first2] * q130_acc[next2] + q130_s[next2])

def q130_i[p in q130_part]: num = periodic(q130_rate[p], month, nominal 12) at reader

def q130_s[p in q130_part]: num at reader
  rule base = (pow(1 + q130_i[p], q130_s_12 * q130_years[p]) - 1) / q130_i[p]
  rule printed beats base v v_soa_s = round((pow(1 + q130_i[p], q130_s_12 * q130_years[p]) - 1) / q130_i[p], q130_s_0_0001, lh11_mode) when lh11_step == printed

def q133_a_left: num at reader
  rule base = (1 - 1 / pow(1 + q133_i, q133_left)) / q133_i
  rule printed beats base v v_soa_s = round((1 - 1 / pow(1 + q133_i, q133_left)) / q133_i, q133_a_left_0_0001, lh11_mode) when lh11_step == printed

def q133_a_n: num = (1 - 1 / pow(1 + q133_i, q133_n)) / q133_i at reader

def q133_bal: num XXX = q133_pay * q133_a_left at reader

def q133_i: num = periodic(q133_rate, month, nominal 12) at reader

def q133_j: num = periodic(q133_new_rate, month, nominal 12) at reader

def q133_last: date = add_months(q133_first_new, q133_months - 1) at reader

def q133_left: int = q133_n - q133_made at reader

def q133_made: int = age_months(q133_first, q133_refi) + 1 at reader

def q133_months: int = round(q133_nreal, 1, ceil) at reader

def q133_n: int = q133_n_12 * q133_years at reader

def q133_nreal: num = -(ln(1 - q133_x) to 1e-12) / (ln(1 + q133_j) to 1e-12) at reader

def q133_pay: num XXX at reader
  rule base = q133_loan / q133_a_n
  rule printed beats base v v_soa_s = round(q133_loan / q133_a_n, minor(XXX), lh11_mode) when lh11_step == printed

def q133_x: num at reader
  note "1 - v^n of the new payments: the balance times the new monthly rate over the new payment"
  rule base = q133_bal * q133_j / q133_new_pay
  rule printed beats base v v_soa_s = round(q133_bal * q133_j / q133_new_pay, q133_x_0_00001, lh11_mode) when lh11_step == printed

def q60_a_left: num = (1 - 1 / pow(1 + q60_i, q60_n - q60_paid)) / q60_i at reader

def q60_a_n: num = (1 - 1 / pow(1 + q60_i, q60_n)) / q60_i at reader

def q60_b: num XXX = q60_r * q60_a_left at reader

def q60_gap[o in choice]: num XXX = q60_newpay * (1 - 1 / pow(1 + periodic(q60_opt[o], month, nominal 12), q60_gap_12 * q60_new_years)) / periodic(q60_opt[o], month, nominal 12) - q60_b at reader

def q60_i: num = periodic(q60_rate, month, nominal 12) at reader

def q60_jm: num = periodic(q60_j, month, nominal 12) at reader

def q60_n: int = q60_n_12 * q60_years at reader

def q60_newpay: num XXX = q60_r - q60_cut at reader

def q60_newpv: num XXX = q60_newpay * (1 - 1 / pow(1 + q60_jm, q60_newpv_12 * q60_new_years)) / q60_jm at reader

def q60_r: num XXX at reader
  rule base = q60_loan / q60_a_n
  rule printed beats base v v_soa_s = round(q60_loan / q60_a_n, minor(XXX), lh11_mode) when lh11_step == printed

def q87_acc: num = pow(1 + q87_i, q87_full + 1) at reader

def q87_bal2: num XXX at reader
  note "the loan accumulated at the effective rate to one year before the first payment"
  rule base v v_soa_s = q87_loan * pow(1 + q87_i, q87_first - 1)

def q87_drop: num XXX = (q87_bal2 - q87_pv_full) * q87_acc at reader

def q87_full: int = round(q87_nreal, 1, floor) at reader

def q87_i: num at reader
  rule base = periodic(q87_d, year, discount)
  rule printed beats base v v_soa_s = round(periodic(q87_d, year, discount), q87_i_0_0001, lh11_mode) when lh11_step == printed

def q87_nreal: num = -(ln(1 - q87_bal2 * q87_i / q87_pmt) to 1e-12) / (ln(1 + q87_i) to 1e-12) at reader

def q87_pv_full: num XXX = q87_pmt * (1 - 1 / pow(1 + q87_i, q87_full)) / q87_i at reader

def q89_a_n: num = (1 - 1 / pow(1 + q89_i, q89_n)) / q89_i at reader

def q89_full: int = round(q89_nreal, 1, floor) at reader

def q89_i: num = periodic(q89_rate, month, nominal 12) at reader

def q89_j: num at reader
  note "the equivalent annual effective rate"
  rule base = periodic(q89_rate, year, nominal 12)
  rule printed beats base v v_soa_s = round(periodic(q89_rate, year, nominal 12), q89_j_0_0001, lh11_mode) when lh11_step == printed

def q89_last: date = add_months(q89_first_pay, q89_months - 1) at reader

def q89_months: int = round(q89_nreal, 1, ceil) at reader

def q89_n: int = q89_n_12 * q89_years at reader

def q89_nreal: num = -(ln(1 - q89_reduced * q89_i / q89_pay) to 1e-12) / (ln(1 + q89_i) to 1e-12) at reader

def q89_pay: num XXX at reader
  rule base = q89_loan / q89_a_n
  rule printed beats base v v_soa_s = round(q89_loan / q89_a_n, minor(XXX), lh11_mode) when lh11_step == printed

def q89_pv_extra: num XXX at reader
  rule base v v_soa_s = sum(q89_extra[y] / pow(1 + q89_j, y) for y in q89_yr)

def q89_reduced: num XXX = q89_loan - q89_pv_extra at reader

ask a130_acc8: round(q130_acc[next2], 0.0001, lh11_mode) law 2026-10-18

ask a130_bal: round(q130_bal, 1, lh11_mode) law 2026-10-18

ask a130_choice: argmin(abs(q130_opt[o] - q130_bal) for o in choice) ties by pos(o) law 2026-10-18

ask a130_s6: round(q130_s[first2], 0.0001, lh11_mode) law 2026-10-18

ask a130_s8: round(q130_s[next2], 0.0001, lh11_mode) law 2026-10-18

ask a133_a192: round(q133_a_left, 0.0001, lh11_mode) law 2026-10-18

ask a133_a240: round(q133_a_n, 0.0001, lh11_mode) law 2026-10-18

ask a133_bal: round(q133_bal, minor(XXX), lh11_mode) law 2026-10-18

ask a133_choice: argmin(abs(days_between(q133_opt[o], q133_last)) for o in choice) ties by pos(o) law 2026-10-18

ask a133_last: q133_last law 2026-10-18

ask a133_left: q133_left law 2026-10-18

ask a133_months: q133_months law 2026-10-18

ask a133_n: round(q133_nreal, 0.01, lh11_mode) law 2026-10-18

ask a133_pay: round(q133_pay, minor(XXX), lh11_mode) law 2026-10-18

ask a133_x: round(q133_x, 0.00001, lh11_mode) law 2026-10-18

ask a60_a144: round(q60_a_left, 0.0001, lh11_mode) law 2026-10-18

ask a60_aj: round(q60_b / q60_newpay, 0.0001, lh11_mode) law 2026-10-18

ask a60_b36: round(q60_b, minor(XXX), lh11_mode) law 2026-10-18

ask a60_choice: argmin(abs(q60_gap[o]) for o in choice) ties by pos(o) law 2026-10-18

ask a60_j: solve q60_newpv == q60_b for q60_j in [1 %/year, 20 %/year] to 0.01 %/year law 2026-10-18

ask a60_jm: solve q60_newpv == q60_b for q60_jm in [0.001, 0.02] to 0.00001 law 2026-10-18

ask a60_r: round(q60_r, minor(XXX), lh11_mode) law 2026-10-18

ask a60_revised: round(q60_newpay, minor(XXX), lh11_mode) law 2026-10-18

ask a87_acc30: round(q87_acc, 0.00001, lh11_mode) law 2026-10-18

ask a87_bal2: round(q87_bal2, 1, lh11_mode) law 2026-10-18

ask a87_choice: argmin(abs(q87_opt[o] - q87_drop) for o in choice) ties by pos(o) law 2026-10-18

ask a87_drop: round(q87_drop, 1, lh11_mode) law 2026-10-18

ask a87_full: q87_full law 2026-10-18

ask a87_i: round(q87_i, 0.0001, lh11_mode) law 2026-10-18

ask a87_n: round(q87_nreal, 0.001, lh11_mode) law 2026-10-18

ask a87_pv29: round(q87_pv_full, 1, lh11_mode) law 2026-10-18

ask a89_choice: argmin(abs(days_between(q89_opt[o], q89_last)) for o in choice) ties by pos(o) law 2026-10-18

ask a89_drop_month: q89_months law 2026-10-18

ask a89_full: q89_full law 2026-10-18

ask a89_j: round(q89_j, 0.0001, lh11_mode) law 2026-10-18

ask a89_last: q89_last law 2026-10-18

ask a89_n: round(q89_nreal, 0.01, lh11_mode) law 2026-10-18

ask a89_pay: round(q89_pay, minor(XXX), lh11_mode) law 2026-10-18

ask a89_pv: round(q89_pv_extra, minor(XXX), lh11_mode) law 2026-10-18

ask a89_reduced: round(q89_reduced, minor(XXX), lh11_mode) law 2026-10-18

